{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2023-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1683590400, "end_date": 1684195199, "month_true_total": 75, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:05:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "138341481", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096901520", "personaname": "给他爱", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199096901520/", "num_games_owned": 125, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 65, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 29, "last_played": 1704003374, "avatar": "35ff5ba3532edbd2ec43f823bd6b76a58bf9a27c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不用管为什么隔了两年我才评论这游戏，这玩意一出我就买的，玩了一半果断就退款，没有其他原因只是这玩意不配与求生并肩，也不能称作是精神续作，特感都是用求生废案去做的，把冷饭用微波炉热一热还能吃的想法，我还能说什么呢？要玩就去玩求生吧。", "timestamp_created": 1684164518, "timestamp_updated": 1684164518, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503448247909545898", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138334289", "author": {"steamid": "76561198411838411", "personaname": "大个", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198411838411/", "num_games_owned": 407, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 59, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 31, "last_played": 1685967774, "avatar": "71ded71f0734746f8a262d315ff745911075b760"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "300元子的游戏运营一年就停更，体量不如十几年前的求生之路2，平衡做的稀烂，\n 骗钱，骗人买终极版，不更新\n     给我点赞牛子增长10cm\n", "timestamp_created": 1684152580, "timestamp_updated": 1684152580, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 270, "votes_funny": 14, "weighted_vote_score": "0.927989184856414795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138326107", "author": {"steamid": "76561199379663697", "personaname": "Laala1120", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199379663697/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2347, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1544, "last_played": 1686039242, "avatar": "7b82f476e4cf9eaba4e4ec4746ce50da07222f0f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "倒阶梯的难度体验\n割裂的游戏体验\n为难而难的各种设定\n部分敷衍的设计", "timestamp_created": 1684130874, "timestamp_updated": 1684130874, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503448247909545898", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138323541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198852621845", "personaname": "月月子Sama", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2331790283/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 23868, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8205, "last_played": 1786368107, "avatar": "ba2a49b5180c4f3449245bab40ea2a064898a013"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "首先想入手这个游戏还是等骨折吧\n但不得不说这个游戏有朋友一起打高难度和蠕虫试炼确实很爽，几个朋友互相下饭着实有意思\n就是打野排有点坐牢", "timestamp_created": 1684123375, "timestamp_updated": 1684123375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520547926425933838", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138299725", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084430027", "personaname": "付小面", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fuxiaomian/", "num_games_owned": 224, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 2183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2183, "last_played": 1679127080, "avatar": "360236e555049f204b12d3a8685a3b9b9764ebfe"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 总体评分：7.3分（10分）[/h1]\n又一款《求生之路》精神续作，这次是当年的《求生之路》原工作室发行的，明显感觉为了吃老本赚钱开发的游戏，游戏整体也算勉强合格。\n[b] 画面：8分[/b]\n整体中规中矩还算合格，有点过度血腥，贴图质量都还可以，但是没有应用太多先进的画面技术，也不算拖后腿。武器枪支的原版皮肤还行，二次元皮肤没有质感。\n[b] 剧情：5分[/b]\n突突突游戏剧情比较弱，不是游戏的重心，不多的剧情中渗透着一股典型的美式影视装逼风格，不是很喜欢。\n[b] 游戏：9分[/b]\n卡牌的形式提供了许多的流派玩法，延长了游戏时间，适合硬核玩家组队挑战高难度关卡，但是却稍微少了末日的压迫感和真实感。物品武器配件的设定竞技性比较强，沉浸感偏少，整体符合游戏定位，关卡内经济系统也算合理。\n[b] 扩展：7分[/b]\n主打多人联机部分，通过合作挑战高难度关卡，后续更新的不积极，没有多少实际内容，最后就停更打骨折促销，我此时入手和好友组队体验了几天。\n", "timestamp_created": 1684083023, "timestamp_updated": 1688896529, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}